{"id":167,"flavor":[{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Although the poison from its fangs isn’t that strong, it’s potent enough to weaken prey that gets caught in its web."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"With threads from its mouth, it fashions sturdy webs that won’t break even if you set a rock on them."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Some fishermen weave its sturdy thread into nets to catch fish Pokémon."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It waits intently until its preferred prey, Cutiefly, gets caught in its web. In fact, it’s quite a patient Pokémon."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"The web spun by Spinarak can be considered its second nervous system. It is said that this Pokémon can determine what kind of prey is touching its web just by the tiny vibrations it feels through the web’s strands."},{"games":["Y","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"It lies still in the same pose for days in its web, waiting for its unsuspecting prey to wander close."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"It spins a web using fine--but durable--thread. It then waits patiently for prey to be trapped."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It sets a trap by spinning a web with thin but strong silk. It waits motionlessly for prey to arrive."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"The web it spins can be considered its second nervous system. It is said that a SPINARAK determines its prey by the tiny vibrations it feels through the web."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"If prey becomes ensnared in its nest of spun string, it waits motionlessly until it becomes dark."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Swarm","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Bug-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Insomnia","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's insomnia prevents it from falling asleep."},{"name":"Sniper","hidden":true,"description":"If the Pokémon's attack lands a critical hit, the attack is powered up even further."}],"eggGroups":["Bug"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":"forest","color":"Green","shape":"Armor","evolution":{"id":167,"name":"Spinarak","condition":null,"children":[{"id":168,"name":"Ariados","condition":"Lv. 22","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,40],[1,81],[5,71],[8,611],[12,184],[15,101],[19,425],[22,154],[26,389],[29,97],[33,42],[36,94],[40,398],[44,440],[47,564],[51,672]],"machine":[491,97,226,450,405,91,527,203,263,492,202,506,282,141,679,101,398,884,182,94,156,184,806,214,188,482,76,180,522,164,241,851,168,92,390,885,474,404],"egg":[50,679,224,400,476],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me3-1","name":"Spinarak","set":"Perfect Order","date":"2026-03-27","rarity":"Common","number":"1","artist":null,"small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me3-1/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me3-1/large"},{"id":"sv6-4","name":"Spinarak","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Common","number":"4","artist":"Saya Tsuruta","img":"sv6/4"},{"id":"swsh12-3","name":"Spinarak","set":"Silver Tempest","date":"2022-11-11","rarity":"Common","number":"3","artist":"Pani Kobayashi","img":"swsh12/3"},{"id":"swsh11-112","name":"Spinarak","set":"Lost Origin","date":"2022-09-09","rarity":"Common","number":"112","artist":"Atsuko Nishida","img":"swsh11/112"},{"id":"pgo-6","name":"Spinarak","set":"Pokémon GO","date":"2022-07-01","rarity":"Common","number":"6","artist":"Yuka Morii","img":"pgo/6"},{"id":"swsh45-43","name":"Spinarak","set":"Shining Fates","date":"2021-02-19","rarity":"Common","number":"43","artist":"sowsow","img":"swsh45/43"},{"id":"swsh3-102","name":"Spinarak","set":"Darkness Ablaze","date":"2020-08-14","rarity":"Common","number":"102","artist":"Kyoko Umemoto","img":"swsh3/102"},{"id":"sm8-9","name":"Spinarak","set":"Lost Thunder","date":"2018-11-02","rarity":"Common","number":"9","artist":"Misa Tsutsui","img":"sm8/9"},{"id":"sm7-5","name":"Spinarak","set":"Celestial